    "m_Type": "UnityEditor.ShaderGraph.StickyNoteData",
    "m_ObjectId": "cacd2fd5bcf342108c4c52a910576929",
    "m_Title": "Water Reflections",
    "m_Content": "This reflects the world based on a camera into the water. I like the effect but it reflects parts of the world you can't see from where you are so it doesn't make as much sense. It works with a texture connected to the SampleTexture2D and a camera plus a script attached to the water called: ",
